From: lcy2080 <lcy2080@onioncrew.com>
Date: Fri, 10 Apr 2026 11:45:48 +0900
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] perf: TUI rendering optimization - batch deltas, memoize
 parts, streaming flag

- Batch streaming delta updates with 50ms flush interval to reduce render frequency
- Add onCleanup for deltaFlushTimer to prevent memory leak on unmount
- Memoize parts array lookup with createMemo to prevent unnecessary child re-renders
- Set streaming=false on completed messages to avoid redundant layout calculations

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
